TY  - JOUR
T1  - Funcionamiento familiar, creencias e inteligencia emocional en pacientes con trastorno obsesivo-compulsivo y sus familiares.
JF  - Family functioning, beliefs regarding illness and emotional intelligence in patients with Obsessive Compulsive Disorder and in their relatives.
A1  - Teresa López Jiménez
A1  - María
A1  - Isabel Barrera Villalpando, María
A1  - Cortés Sotres
A1  - José F
A1  - Guines Metzi
A1  - Martha Jaime
A1  - L
