T1  - Profiling the most elderly parkinson's disease patients: Does age or disease duration matter?
JF  - PLoS ONE
A1  - Virameteekul Sasivimol
A1  - Phokaewvarangkul Onanong
A1  - Bhidayasiri Roongroj
KW  - eppi-reviewer
