T1  - Challenges of Telemonitoring Programs for Complex Chronic Conditions: Randomized Controlled Trial With an Embedded Qualitative Study
JF  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL INTERNET RESEARCH
A1  - Ware P
A1  - Shah A
A1  - Ross HJ
