T1  - Beyond police crisis intervention: moving 'upstream' to manage cases and places of behavioral health vulnerability
JF  - International journal of law and psychiatry
A1  - Wood Jennifer D
A1  - Beierschmitt Laura
KW  - eppi-reviewer
