AB  - Objective To explore the effect of double⁃center nursing on self disease condition management ability and quality of life after elective PCI in the patients with coronary heart disease. Methods Ninety coronary heart disease patients un⁃ dergoing elective PCI in the department of heart disease of this hospital from January 2016 to June 2017 were selected and ran⁃ domly divided into the control group and intervention group according to the random number table method，45 cases in each group. The control group adopted the general nursing and the intervention group adopted the double⁃center nursing. The negative psychology，disease condition management ability and quality of life after 4⁃week nursing were compared between the two groups with the questionnaire investigation mode by adopting the outpatient review or telephone follow⁃up. Results The self rating anxiety scale（SAS）score and self rating depression scale（SDS）score after nursing in the intervention group were significantly lower than those in the control group；the disease condition management scores of disease cognition，emotional management，symptom management，drug use and medication compliance in the intervention group were significantly higher than those in the control group；the living quality scores of physical function，social function，emotional function，mental health，somatic pain，body vitality and overall health in the intervention group were significantly higher than those in the control group，the differences were statisti⁃ cally significant（P<0.05）. Conclusion The implementation of double⁃center nursing in coronary heart disease patients under⁃ going elective PCI can obviously decrease the patient′s negative psychology of anxiety and depression symptoms，increases the patient′s ability to manage the disease condition，thereby increases the quality of life and improves the long⁃term prognosis，and is worth popularizing in clinic. (English) [ABSTRACT FROM AUTHOR] 目的探讨双心护理对择期冠心病经皮冠状动脉介入治疗（PCI）后患者自我病情管理能力及生活质量 的影响。方法选取2016 年1 月至2017 年6 月该院心病科收治的行择期冠心病PCI 患者90 例，采用随机数字表法分 为对照组和干预组，每组45 例。对照组采用一般护理，干预组采用双心护理，采用门诊复查或电话随访以问卷调查的方 式比较两组患者护理4 周后负性心理、病情管理能力及生活质量。结果干预组患者护理后焦虑自评量表评分和抑郁 自评量表评分均明显低于对照组，疾病认识、情绪管理、症状管理、药物使用、用药依从性等病情管理能力评分均明显高 于对照组，生理功能、社会功能、情感职能、精神健康、躯体疼痛、机体活力、总体健康等生活质量评分均明显高于对照 组，差异均有统计学意义（P<0.05）。结论对择期行冠心病PCI 患者实施双心护理可明显降低患者焦虑、抑郁等负性心 理，提高患者病情管理能力，从而提高患者生活质量，改善患者远期预后，值得在临床上推广应用。 (Chinese) [ABSTRACT FROM AUTHOR] Copyright of Journal of Modern Medicine & Health is the property of Journal of Modern Medicine & Health and its content may not be copied or emailed to multiple sites or posted to a listserv without the copyright holder's express written permission. However, users may print, download, or email articles for individual use. This abstract may be abridged. No warranty is given about the accuracy of the copy. Users should refer to the original published version of the material for the full abstract. (Copyright applies to all Abstracts.)
